  "title": "Innolume Selects Veeco Gen2000™ MBE System to Expand Quantum Dot Laser Production - Veeco",
  "summary": "Plainview, N.Y., July 21, 2026 – Veeco Instruments Inc. (Nasdaq: VECO) today announced that Innolume, a leading vertically integrated developer and manufacturer of quantum dot (QD) lasers, has purchased a GEN2000™ Molecular Beam Epitaxy (MBE) system to expand production of gallium arsenide (GaAs)-based quantum dot lasers for next-generation optical transceivers and silicon photonics applications. The […]",
